  {%- endcomment -%}
  <button type="button" class="spp__btn spp__btn--primary" style="margin-top:18px;" data-spp-go="subscription">Keep my subscription</button>
  <div class="spp__quiet-row">
    <button type="button" class="spp__btn spp__btn--link" data-spp-act="reasonContinue">Continue cancelling</button>
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%} ---------- 6 · Adjust your routine ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  Step 6 of the approved "VetPets Portal V2" cancel flow: the reason-
  personalized "Adjust your routine" screen. It keeps the screen key
  `cancel-offer` (and so every existing back/forward/tracking hook that
  names it), but what it SHOWS now depends on the reason chosen on step 5:

    Too much product     -> move my next delivery 30 days later
    Not seeing results   -> "Give the routine time to work"
    Dog doesn't like it  -> routine guidance
    Too expensive / other / the rest -> the adjustment options

  The 40% offer is NOT one of this screen's recommendations any more — it
  used to be "Too expensive"'s answer here, but it now shows exactly once,
  on its own screen (cancel-savings, step 7), for every reason the backend
  marks eligible. "Too expensive" falls back to the same adjustment-options
  content "Something else" already used.

  Every block below is rendered hidden and switched by renderRetain() in
  subscription-portal.js — nothing here is a decision.

  HONESTY RULES (see subscription-portal.js, RETAIN_*):
   - Phoenix has NO recurring-frequency or pause operation. Nothing on this
     screen says a frequency changed. "Move" and "Pause until a date" both
     move the NEXT BILLING DATE via the proven update-next-billing-date
     write, and success is shown only after a fresh re-read confirms it.
   - "Keep my RoutineCare active" changes nothing in Phoenix, so it is
     tracked as a kept recommendation and is NEVER counted as a save.
{%- endcomment -%}
<section class="spp__screen" data-spp-screen="cancel-offer" hidden aria-labelledby="spp-co-h">
  <div class="spp__narrow">
    <div class="spp__step-row">
      <button type="button" class="spp__back" data-spp-go="cancel-reason">
        {% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'chevron-left' %}Back
      </button>
      <span class="spp__cancel-step">Cancel &middot; Step 6 of 8</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="spp__h1" id="spp-co-h">Adjust your routine</h1>
    <p class="spp__lede">
      Cancelling is one option. Based on what you told us there is probably a change
      that fits better, and nothing happens until you choose it.
    </p>

    <div class="spp__line spp__retain-told">
      <span>
        <b style="display:block;">You told us</b>
        <span data-spp-field="reason.label" style="color:var(--spp-body);">Not given</span>
      </span>
      <button type="button" class="spp__btn spp__btn--link" style="min-height:40px;" data-spp-go="cancel-reason">Change</button>
    </div>

    <div class="spp__card spp__retain" data-spp-retain
         data-spp-asset-base="{{ 'spp-cancel-benefits-mobile.jpg' | asset_url }}">
      <div class="spp__eyebrow">Recommended for you</div>
      <h2 class="spp__h2 spp__retain-title" data-spp-field="retain.title">Take 40% off your next delivery</h2>
      <p class="spp__lede spp__retain-body" data-spp-field="retain.body"></p>

      {%- comment -%} move: the date now vs the date after the change {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="spp__retain-block" data-spp-retain-block="delay" hidden>
        <div class="spp__retain-pair">
          <div class="spp__line" style="padding:0 0 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--spp-hair);">
            <span>Now</span><b data-spp-field="retain.dateNow">Sep 8</b>
          </div>
          <div class="spp__line" style="padding:12px 0 0;">
            <span>Recommended</span><b style="color:var(--spp-primary);" data-spp-field="retain.dateAfter">Oct 8</b>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} not seeing results {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="spp__retain-block" data-spp-retain-block="keep" hidden>
        <span class="spp__retain-chip">
          <span data-spp-field="retain.careLabel">Dental care</span>
          <span class="spp__retain-chip-note">from why you started</span>
        </span>

        {%- comment -%}
          The before/after column exists ONLY for Dental and Eye, and only
          once its approved image has actually loaded (JS un-hides it from the
          <img> load event). Until then — and always for Coat, Paw and Other —
          there is no column, no empty slot and no placeholder, and the
          timeline is full width. Files: spp-before-after-dental.jpg and
          spp-before-after-eye.jpg (1:1, BEFORE stacked over AFTER). Temporary
          DEV visual assets — not verified customer results. No Ear image.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="spp__retain-tlwrap" data-spp-ba-wrap>
          <div class="spp__retain-ba" data-spp-ba hidden>
            <img data-spp-ba-img alt="" width="720" height="720" decoding="async">
          </div>
          <ol class="spp__retain-tl" data-spp-list="retainTimeline">
            <template data-spp-tpl="retainTimeline">
              <li class="spp__retain-tl-item">
                <span class="spp__retain-tl-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>
                <span class="spp__retain-tl-text">
                  <b data-spp-field="label">Weeks 1&ndash;2</b>
                  <span data-spp-field="body"></span>
                </span>
              </li>
            </template>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <p class="spp__retain-note" data-spp-field="retain.productNote"></p>

        <div class="spp__retain-warn" role="note">
          <span class="spp__retain-warn-icon" aria-hidden="true">{% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'clock-action', size: 20 %}</span>
          <span>
            <b>Don&rsquo;t lose the progress you&rsquo;ve started</b>
            <span>Stopping early can allow the original problem to return. Consistent care helps protect your dog&rsquo;s long-term health.</span>
          </span>
        </div>

        <figure class="spp__retain-review" data-spp-retain-review hidden>
          <blockquote data-spp-field="retain.reviewQuote"></blockquote>
          <figcaption>
            <span class="spp__review-verified">{% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'check-circle', size: 12 %}Verified</span>
            <b data-spp-field="retain.reviewName"></b>
            <span data-spp-field="retain.reviewCategory"></span>
          </figcaption>
        </figure>

        <div class="spp__retain-guarantee">
          {% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'check-circle', size: 20 %}
          <span>You&rsquo;re protected by our <b>100-Day Money-Back Guarantee</b> while you give the routine time to work.</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      {%- comment -%} routine guidance {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="spp__retain-block" data-spp-retain-block="easier" hidden>
        <div class="spp__retain-tips">
          <div class="spp__retain-tips-title">Try these first</div>
          <ul data-spp-list="retainTips">
            <template data-spp-tpl="retainTips"><li data-spp-field="text"></li></template>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <ul class="spp__retain-points" data-spp-list="retainPoints">
        <template data-spp-tpl="retainPoints">
          <li>{% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'check-circle', size: 16 %}<span data-spp-field="text"></span></li>
        </template>
      </ul>

      <p class="spp__retain-error" data-spp-retain-error role="alert" hidden></p>

      <button type="button" class="spp__btn spp__btn--primary" data-spp-act="retainPrimary">
        <span data-spp-field="retain.cta">Keep my RoutineCare active</span>
      </button>
      <p class="spp__fine spp__retain-foot" data-spp-field="retain.foot"></p>
    </div>

    <h2 class="spp__h2" style="margin-top:26px;">Other ways to adjust your routine</h2>
    <div class="spp__choices" role="radiogroup" aria-label="Other ways to adjust your routine" data-spp-list="retainAdjRows" style="margin-top:12px;">
      <template data-spp-tpl="retainAdjRows">
        <button type="button" class="spp__choice spp__choice--stacked" role="radio" aria-checked="false" data-spp-pick="retainAdj">
          <span class="spp__radio"></span>
          <span class="spp__choice-text">
            <b data-spp-field="label">Skip next delivery</b>
            <span data-spp-field="meta"></span>
          </span>
        </button>
      </template>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%}
      One inline panel per chosen adjustment (skip / move / frequency / pause).
      All four run through the SAME proven update-next-billing-date write;
      see act('retainAdjust').
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="spp__retain-panel" data-spp-retain-panel hidden>
      <p class="spp__retain-panel-lead" data-spp-field="retain.adjLead"></p>

      <div data-spp-retain-tiles hidden>
        <div class="spp__choices spp__choices--row" role="radiogroup" aria-label="How far to move it" data-spp-list="retainAdjTiles">
          <template data-spp-tpl="retainAdjTiles">
            <button type="button" class="spp__tile" role="radio" aria-checked="false" data-spp-pick="retainTile">
              <span data-spp-field="label"></span>
            </button>
          </template>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div data-spp-retain-date-wrap hidden style="margin-top:12px;">
        <label class="spp__label" for="spp-retain-date">Resume on</label>
        <input type="date" id="spp-retain-date" data-spp-retain-date class="spp__input"
          aria-describedby="spp-retain-date-error"
          style="width:100%;box-sizing:border-box;min-height:48px;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid rgba(13,35,64,.18);background:var(--spp-surface);font:500 15px/1.2 var(--spp-font);color:var(--spp-ink);">
      </div>

      <div class="spp__info" data-spp-retain-fromto style="margin:14px 0;" hidden>
        <span data-spp-field="retain.adjFrom">Sep 8</span>
        <span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span>
        <b data-spp-field="retain.adjTo">Sep 15</b>
      </div>

      <p id="spp-retain-date-error" class="spp__retain-error" data-spp-retain-adj-error role="alert" hidden></p>

      <button type="button" class="spp__btn spp__btn--secondary" data-spp-act="retainAdjust">
        <span data-spp-field="label.retainAdjust">Confirm this change</span>
      </button>
    </div>

    <div class="spp__quiet-row">
      <button type="button" class="spp__btn spp__btn--link" data-spp-go="cancel-savings">Continue cancellation</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%} ---------- 7 · 40% off next delivery ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
{%- comment -%}
  The ONE place the retention offer is shown, for every cancellation
  reason the backend marks eligible — not gated by which reason was
  picked on step 5. show() in subscription-portal.js redirects this
  screen straight to cancel-confirm the moment
  subscription.retentionOfferRedeemed is true, exactly like the old
  reason-gated version did, so a customer who already redeemed it skips
  ONLY this screen and still reaches Final Confirmation.

  Every field below (offer.percent, offer.standard, offer.currentPrice,
  offer.price, cancel.focusName, subscription.nextOrderShort,
  label.acceptOffer) is already populated globally by viewModel()/render()
  — the same fields the old embedded "offer" block on cancel-offer used —
  so this screen needs no new JS plumbing beyond act('acceptOffer'), which
  is unchanged.
{%- endcomment -%}
<section class="spp__screen" data-spp-screen="cancel-savings" hidden aria-labelledby="spp-csv-h">
  <div class="spp__narrow">
    <div class="spp__step-row">
      <button type="button" class="spp__back" data-spp-go="cancel-offer">
        {% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'chevron-left' %}Back
      </button>
      <span class="spp__cancel-step">Cancel &middot; Step 7 of 8</span>
    </div>

    <div class="spp__eyebrow">Recommended for you</div>
    <h1 class="spp__h1" id="spp-csv-h">Take <span data-spp-field="offer.percent">40</span>% off your next delivery</h1>
    <p class="spp__lede">
      Keep the routine going for less this time. Once that delivery ships, your normal
      RoutineCare pricing and the usual <span data-spp-field="offer.standard">20</span>% saving
      resume automatically &mdash; nothing to remember, nothing to cancel later.
    </p>

    <div class="spp__card spp__retain">
      <div class="spp__retain-pair">
        <div class="spp__line" style="padding:0 0 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--spp-hair);">
          <span><b data-spp-field="cancel.focusName">Routine Care</b> &middot; <span data-spp-field="subscription.nextOrderShort">Sep 8</span></span>
          <b style="color:var(--spp-primary);font-size:19px;"><span data-spp-field="offer.percent">40</span>% off</b>
        </div>
        <div class="spp__line" style="padding:12px 0 0;">
          <span>Every delivery after that</span>
          <b>RoutineCare price, <span data-spp-field="offer.standard">20</span>% saving</b>
        </div>
      </div>

      <ul class="spp__retain-points" style="margin-top:16px;">
        <li>{% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'check-circle', size: 16 %}<span>Applies to your <span data-spp-field="subscription.nextOrderShort">Sep 8</span> delivery only.</span></li>
        <li>{% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'check-circle', size: 16 %}<span>Normal RoutineCare pricing and the <span data-spp-field="offer.standard">20</span>% saving resume automatically after it.</span></li>
        <li>{% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'check-circle', size: 16 %}<span>Free shipping, flexible deliveries and the 100-day guarantee are unchanged.</span></li>
      </ul>

      <p class="spp__retain-error" data-spp-offer-error role="alert" hidden></p>

      <button type="button" class="spp__btn spp__btn--primary" data-spp-act="acceptOffer">
        <span data-spp-field="label.acceptOffer">Apply 40% to my next delivery</span>
      </button>
      <p class="spp__fine spp__retain-foot">One delivery only. No code to enter.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="spp__quiet-row">
      <button type="button" class="spp__btn spp__btn--link" data-spp-go="cancel-confirm">No thanks, continue cancelling</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%} ---------- 8 · Confirm ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="spp__screen" data-spp-screen="cancel-confirm" hidden aria-labelledby="spp-cc-h">
  {%- comment -%}
    data-spp-go is a fallback for a customer who somehow never eligible for
    JS at all; the real target is decided every render in
    renderCancelJourney(), because it depends on retentionOfferRedeemed,
    which can only be known once the subscription has loaded. A redeemed
    customer must land on Adjust your routine — the screen immediately
    before the offer in the new order — never back on the offer screen
    show() already refuses to display.
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <button type="button" class="spp__back" data-spp-confirm-back data-spp-go="cancel-savings">
    {% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'chevron-left' %}Back
  </button>

  <div class="spp__narrow">
    {%- comment -%}
      No identifier here. The heading carried the subscription reference,
      which in live data is Phoenix's own subscription number — an internal
      identifier of a third-party billing system, shown to a customer who has
      exactly one subscription and therefore never needed it to tell which one
      they were cancelling.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <h1 class="spp__h1" id="spp-cc-h" style="margin-bottom:10px;">
      Cancel your subscription?
    </h1>
    <p class="spp__lede" style="line-height:1.5;">Here is exactly what happens if you confirm.</p>

    {%- comment -%}
      The first fact is the one that matters most here: cancelling this
      subscription ends EVERY product in it, not just whichever one was
      named on the earlier screens — see the 'cancelFacts' listData case,
      which states this explicitly whenever there is more than one product
      to disambiguate.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="spp__card spp__card--rows" style="margin-bottom:16px;padding:6px 18px;">
      <div data-spp-list="cancelFacts">
        <template data-spp-tpl="cancelFacts">
          <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-start;padding:14px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--spp-hair);">
            <span style="flex:0 0 auto;margin-top:2px;color:var(--spp-accent);">
              {% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'check-circle', size: 19 %}
            </span>
            <p style="margin:0;font:500 14.5px/1.5 var(--spp-font);color:var(--spp-body);" data-spp-field="text"></p>
          </div>
        </template>
      </div>
    </div>

    {%- comment -%}
      What they told us, shown back before they commit. A customer who picked
      the wrong reason a few screens ago can correct it here, and the record
      we keep is the one they actually meant.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <div class="spp__line" data-spp-reason-row hidden
         style="background:var(--spp-surface-neutral,#F2FAFE);border-radius:14px;padding:14px 15px;margin-bottom:18px;">
      <span>
        <b style="display:block;">Reason on record</b>
        <span data-spp-field="reason.label" style="color:var(--spp-body);">Not given</span>
      </span>
      <button type="button" class="spp__btn spp__btn--link" style="min-height:40px;" data-spp-go="cancel-reason">Change</button>
    </div>

    <button type="button" class="spp__btn spp__btn--danger" data-spp-act="cancel">
      <span data-spp-field="label.cancel">Yes, cancel my subscription</span>
    </button>
    <button type="button" class="spp__btn spp__btn--secondary" style="margin-top:10px;min-height:52px;font-size:15.5px;" data-spp-go="dashboard">Keep my subscription</button>
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%} ---------- 9 · Cancelled ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="spp__screen spp__centred" data-spp-screen="cancel-done" hidden aria-labelledby="spp-cd-h">
  <div style="padding:26px 0;">
    <div class="spp__disc spp__disc--neutral">
      {% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'cancelled-check' %}
    </div>

    <h1 class="spp__h1 spp__h1--lg" id="spp-cd-h" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Your subscription is cancelled</h1>
    {%- comment -%}
      No identifier, and no promise about email.

      This paragraph named Phoenix's own subscription number — an internal id
      from a third-party billing system — and then promised a confirmation to
      an address it rendered from `customer.email`, which is not populated on
      this screen. Live customers read "A confirmation is on its way to ."

      Both are gone. The cancellation is stated as the fact it is, which needs
      neither an identifier nor an address to be true.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <p class="spp__lede" style="max-width:400px;margin:0 auto 22px;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;">
      Your cancellation is confirmed.
      <strong style="color:var(--spp-ink);">No further charges will be made</strong> and nothing more will ship.
    </p>

    <div class="spp__card" style="max-width:460px;margin:0 auto 20px;text-align:left;border-radius:18px;box-shadow:none;">
      <div class="spp__line" style="padding:9px 0;font-size:14.5px;"><span>Last delivery</span><b>10 July 2026</b></div>
      <div class="spp__line" style="padding:9px 0;font-size:14.5px;"><span>Cancelled delivery</span><b><span data-spp-field="subscription.nextOrderShort">Sep 8</span> — not shipping</b></div>
      <div class="spp__line" style="padding:9px 0;font-size:14.5px;" data-spp-loyalty hidden><span>VetPoints kept</span><b><span data-spp-field="loyalty.points">640</span> for 12 months</b></div>
    </div>

    <button type="button" class="spp__btn spp__btn--primary" style="max-width:460px;margin:0 auto;" data-spp-go="reactivate">Reactivate subscription</button>
    <button type="button" class="spp__btn spp__btn--link" style="max-width:460px;margin:8px auto 0;" data-spp-go="inactive">View cancelled subscriptions</button>
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%} ---------- Reactivate ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="spp__screen" data-spp-screen="reactivate" hidden aria-labelledby="spp-re-h">
  <button type="button" class="spp__back" data-spp-go="inactive">
    {% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'chevron-left' %}Back
  </button>

  <h1 class="spp__h1" id="spp-re-h">Restart the routine</h1>
  <p class="spp__lede">Same products, same subscriber price. Pick when the first delivery should arrive.</p>

  <div class="spp__card">
    <div style="display:flex;gap:13px;align-items:center;padding-bottom:14px;border-bottom:1px solid rgba(13,35,64,.08);">
      <div class="spp__next-thumbs" data-spp-list="lineThumbs2">
        <template data-spp-tpl="lineThumbs2">
          <span class="spp__thumb spp__thumb--sm" data-spp-thumb><img data-spp-img alt=""></span>
        </template>
      </div>
      <div style="flex:1;min-width:0;font:600 15px/1.35 var(--spp-font);color:var(--spp-ink);">
        <span data-spp-field="subscription.quantitySummary">FreshWipes ×2, EyeWipes ×1</span>
        <span style="display:block;font:500 13.5px/1.4 var(--spp-font);color:var(--spp-muted);margin-top:3px;">
          <span data-spp-field="pricing.total">$62.73</span> per delivery
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div style="padding-top:16px;">
      <div style="font:600 13px/1 var(--spp-font);color:var(--spp-ink);margin-bottom:10px;">First delivery</div>
      <div class="spp__choices spp__choices--row" role="radiogroup" aria-label="First delivery" data-spp-list="restartDates">
        <template data-spp-tpl="restartDates">
          <button type="button" class="spp__tile spp__tile--wide" role="radio" aria-checked="false" data-spp-pick="restart">
            <span data-spp-field="label">As soon as possible</span>
          </button>
        </template>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <button type="button" class="spp__btn spp__btn--primary" style="margin-top:16px;" data-spp-act="reactivate">
    <span data-spp-field="label.reactivate">Reactivate subscription</span>
  </button>
</section>

{%- comment -%} ---------- Inactive list ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="spp__screen" data-spp-screen="inactive" hidden aria-labelledby="spp-in-h">
  <button type="button" class="spp__back" data-spp-go="dashboard">
    {% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'chevron-left' %}Overview
  </button>

  <h1 class="spp__h1" id="spp-in-h" style="margin-bottom:18px;">Cancelled &amp; inactive</h1>

  <div class="spp__grid spp__grid--wide" data-spp-list="inactiveSubs">
    <template data-spp-tpl="inactiveSubs">
      <div class="spp__card" style="border:1px solid rgba(13,35,64,.12);box-shadow:none;">
        {%- comment -%}
          The reference chip here was the same internal Phoenix id. The card
          already identifies the subscription the way a customer would — by
          product, cadence and the date it ended — so the id told them nothing
          they could use.
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-end;margin-bottom:14px;">
          <span class="spp__badge spp__badge--plain spp__badge--neutral" data-spp-field="statusLabel">Cancelled</span>
        </div>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:13px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:14px;">
          <span class="spp__thumb spp__thumb--muted" style="width:54px;height:54px;" data-spp-thumb><img data-spp-img alt=""></span>
          <div style="flex:1;min-width:0;">
            <div style="font:600 15px/1.3 var(--spp-font);color:var(--spp-ink);" data-spp-field="name">GloveWipes pack</div>
            <div class="spp__delivery-meta" data-spp-field="meta">Was every 30 days · cancelled 4 June 2026</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="spp__btn spp__btn--secondary" style="min-height:48px;font-size:15px;" data-spp-go="reactivate">Reactivate</button>
      </div>
    </template>
  </div>
</section>

{%- comment -%} ---------- Empty account ---------- {%- endcomment -%}
<section class="spp__screen spp__centred" data-spp-screen="empty" hidden aria-labelledby="spp-em-h">
  <div style="padding:30px 0;">
    <div class="spp__disc spp__disc--lg" style="color:var(--spp-accent);opacity:.85;">
      {% render 'spp-icon', icon: 'paw', size: 44 %}
    </div>

    <h1 class="spp__h1" id="spp-em-h" style="line-height:1.25;margin-bottom:10px;">No subscriptions yet</h1>
    <p class="spp__lede" style="max-width:380px;margin:0 auto 22px;font-weight:400;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;">
      {%- comment -%} Identity-free: not a slot, so live mode cannot blank it. {%- endcomment -%}
      When you start a routine, it shows up here &mdash; with delivery dates and one-tap skip.
    </p>

    <button type="button" class="spp__btn spp__btn--primary" style="max-width:420px;margin:0 auto;" data-spp-go="dashboard">
      Browse the daily routine
    </button>

    <p style="margin:16px 0 0;font:500 14px/1.5 var(--spp-font);color:var(--spp-muted);">
